Hi Mike,

You can do it in ggplot2 the same way you did it with base graphics, e.g.,

> dta$y <- predict(dta.nls)
> library(ggplot2)
> ggplot(dta, aes(x = Damage_cm, y = Gossypol)) + geom_point() + geom_line(aes(y = y))

Best,
Ista

