Hi Tylere,

Why would you want to make something that is broken ;)?

If it is just one point, you could give it its own facet.  If you tweak
the y-axis, you could create the impression that the line passes through
the point.

I've made plots similar to what you want.  It is helpful to not set the
default data set, and specify one for each layer.

so:

ggplot() + ...

There you can add things as you wish.

Cheers,
Brian

